				"name": "Wire",
				"version": {
					"major": 7,
					"minor": 25,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Silhouette Kinect - paper-cut look from a Kinect mask. Put it on the Spout clip 'KinectMask' (sent by kinect_mask.py in Resolume Wire\/Kinect: Kinect body index or depth minus empty room, white = person). Works with projection and stage light, because the Kinect measures depth with its own infrared light. The 512 x 424 Kinect image is fitted into 16:9 without distortion (empty bands left and right get the Background Color). Silhouette Color fills the people, Background Color fills the rest (alpha 0 = overlay). Raw Mask shows the incoming mask underneath, Silhouette Opacity fades the silhouettes. Mask Threshold cuts the mask, Edge Softness blurs the outline, Mirror flips left\/right.",
			"displayName": "Silhouette Kinect",
			"identifier": "34ec8fa9-e343-4750-a505-6967d78b13a6",
